aarcs_backend/node_modules/

# Flutter/Dart build files (run: flutter build)
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# ============================================
# IDE/Editor files (personal preferences)
# ============================================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# ============================================
# Large SDK files (should use system Flutter)
# ============================================
aarcs_ambulance/Dart/
**/dart-sdk/
